msgstr "En Brevo, abre Transactional → Settings → Webhook, añade la URL y selecciona Delivered, Hard bounce, Soft bounce, Invalid email y Complaint."

msgid "In Mailgun, open Sending → Webhooks, add the URL for Delivered, Permanent failure, Temporary failure and Spam complaints, and paste the HTTP webhook signing key below."
msgstr "En Mailgun, abre Sending → Webhooks, añade la URL para Delivered, Permanent failure, Temporary failure y Spam complaints, y pega abajo la HTTP webhook signing key."

msgid "In Postmark, open your server → Webhooks → Add webhook, paste the URL and select Delivery, Bounce and Spam complaint."
msgstr "En Postmark, abre tu servidor → Webhooks → Add webhook, pega la URL y selecciona Delivery, Bounce y Spam complaint."

msgid "In the Microsoft 365 admin center, open the user → Mail → Manage email apps and enable \"Authenticated SMTP\"."
msgstr "En el Centro de administración de Microsoft 365, abre el usuario → Correo → Administrar aplicaciones de correo electrónico y activa «SMTP autenticado»."

msgid "Inboxes show roughly the first 40–80 characters; the rest is cut off, on phones even earlier."
msgstr "Las bandejas de entrada muestran aproximadamente los primeros 40–80 caracteres; el resto se corta, y en los móviles incluso antes."

